## Rules

- Hardware: **x86 deck** — no ARM/Pi work unless STATUS says so.
- One roadmap step per stretch of work; update STATUS when done.
- Languages: host translators/cross-compile — no in-OS JVM/CPython.
- Preserve invariants in MAP (higher-half, single-sector ATA, no blocking in IRQ, reap DEAD tasks).
- `make test` after kernel/user behavior changes.
- No commit/push unless user asks.
